+- **Final archival/workplan findings (NR156/NR157):** actual Container39 entries2606358/2606353 narrow source-paper targets while originals remain unavailable. An eleven-question semantic crosswalk rejects count-only abandonment, retaining specific oversight/program/approval/receipt gaps.
